 at your own pace. There are no timers, just pure discovery. The immersive environment draws you into a narrative of intrigue and beauty.\n\nCrafted with VR passion, this journey awaits. Wishlist now and prepare to unlock the gallery\u2019s deepest mysteries!", "short_description": "Step Into The Gallery: VR Secrets - Immerse yourself in a VR art gallery where every painting holds a hidden puzzle."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nannings.nz/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NanningsGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.nannings.nz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26435837642669773"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1233526128986845_825607218310210448_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AWl4bmhasZEQ7kNvwHfWObL&_nc_oc=AdpPZZTC0G3imleMkfnufYcKfAHHC6yAC9xEarKYLYYOGmL6EjqHh35ra54rXpzNXNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGtFbISnzYquy_QQ2RFRpeRnntJQhgtQTxPDp-d8o50g&oe=6AEC93CA"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "The Gallery: VR Secrets", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES"